> teleport volcano bottom

Volcano Bottom
You are at the bottom of a large dormant volcano. High above you light may be seen entering from the cone of the volcano. The only exit here is to the north.

There is a very large and extremely heavy wicker basket with a cloth bag here. Inside the basket is a metal receptacle of some kind. Attached to the basket on the outside is a piece of wire. The cloth bag is draped over the the basket.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
